{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:103486","published":"2026-11-25T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-25T14:30:02.676288448Z","related":["CVE-2026-35189","CVE-2026-54872","CVE-2026-75806"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-35189","CVE-2026-54872","CVE-2026-75806"],"summary":"Moderate: openssl security update","details":"OpenSSL is a toolkit that implements the Secure Sockets Layer (SSL) and Transport Layer Security (TLS) protocols, as well as a full-strength general-purpose cryptography library.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * openssl: openssl: Denial of Service via excessive memory allocation in CRL distribution point processing (CVE-2026-35189)\n  * openssl: OpenSSL: Private key recovery via timing side-channel in generic elliptic curve operations (CVE-2026-54872)\n  * openssl: OpenSSL: Denial of Service via undersized DTLS record (CVE-2026-75806)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"openssl","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/openssl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:1.1.1k-19.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:103486.json"}},{"package":{"name":"openssl-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/openssl-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:1.1.1k-19.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:103486.json"}},{"package":{"name":"openssl-libs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/openssl-libs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:1.1.1k-19.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/alma